sequenceDiagram
	participant Commerce as Commerce (Next.js 16 MFE)
	participant Basket as Basket API (.NET 11 + Redis)
	participant Catalog as Catalog API (.NET 11 + gRPC)
	participant Ordering as Ordering API (.NET 11 + orderingdb)
	participant Finance as Finance (Azure Functions)

	Commerce ->> Basket: HTTPS GET /basket/api/v1/baskets
	Basket ->> Catalog: gRPC GetBooks (live titles & prices)
	Catalog -->> Basket: Book details
	Basket -->> Commerce: 200 OK (enriched basket)

	Commerce ->> Ordering: HTTPS POST /ordering/api/v1/orders (x-request-id)
	Ordering ->> Basket: gRPC GetBasket
	Ordering ->> Catalog: gRPC GetBooks (lock PriceSale ?? Price)
	Ordering -->> Commerce: 201 Created (orderId)
	Ordering ->> Finance: Kafka UserCheckedOutIntegrationEvent

	Finance ->> Basket: Kafka PlaceOrderCommand
	Basket ->> Finance: Kafka BasketDeletedComplete / BasketDeletedFailed
